              "value": "Steal Breath"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation, necromancy, occult)\n\nThe kurobozu leans over and sucks the breath from the target, who must attempt a DC 22 Fortitude save. Regardless of the result, the creature is exposed to black apoxia and its breath reeks of carrion for 1 minute.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature can't speak for 1 minute.\nFailure: The creature becomes sickened 2 and can't speak for 1 minute.\nCritical Failure: As failure, plus the creature falls unconscious and begins suffocating."
            },
